r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows February to March and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025, August to September came in at 48% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 59% on the middle. Grid 23887 had its driest year in 1987 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
